{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "33f7e09cb3035f1f2ff4f6f62a965f8d0f7193119532578225cd13f057419733", "ja": "クランクインの前に……♪", "zh": "在开镜前……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9d246033c2861fa999d19fea83efbf5a1f51a203bf1c3ac78f520352759d8bdf", "ja": "ドラマのオーディションに受かったことを\n喜び合う歌織、風花、このみ、麗花の4人。\n演じる役について話しているうちに意外と\nお互いを知らないと気付き、作中のキャラを\n真似て、ルームシェアをする事になる。", "zh": "歌织、风花、木实与丽花四人，\n都很高兴能通过电视剧试镜。\n当她们聊起饰演的角色时，\n却意外发现对彼此不太了解，\n便决定模仿剧中角色展开共居生活。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "68c884875586f8bb5b1e1d24c886b61835aefce1cb424a53b16e0bc023bd4821", "ja": "みんな、集まってくれてありがとう。\nこれからミーティングを始める……んだけど。", "zh": "各位，谢谢你们过来这里，\n我们接下来要开始会议……但在这之前。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "afde75c12f261cd890be8bdad4d7cac80f1a9d163ae63c1d6b7e2f513fabc078", "ja": "麗花が今食べてるそのプリン、横の方に\n「茜ちゃん！」ってデカデカと書いてあるんだが……。", "zh": "丽花你现在正在吃的布丁，\n盒子侧面写着大大的「小茜！」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "465e6cc27869e8315e009d7754b06c774a5ac6d66e81e2d217833f5c903d26e2", "ja": "あ、本当だ！\nイラスト付きで、かわいいサインですね♪", "zh": "啊，真的耶！\n旁边还有画图，好可爱的签名喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "4181d65feaa9e6040630c0f0bcb5117a7659baa437e71bd6183bbe55bf3d2b27", "ja": "茜ちゃんのプリン、特別おいしいです。\n{$P$}さんも一口食べてみますか？", "zh": "小茜的布丁特别好吃。\n{$P$}先生要不要也吃一口看看？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0ed89bcc05bc0ad8f346c51ac025f6a7904971b7a8228b8a274ee551f6f62a60", "ja": "いや、遠慮しておくよ。……後で、茜のために\nコンビニでプリン買っておくか……。", "zh": "不，我就不吃了。\n……之后去便利商店帮茜买个布丁吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "53562566e7e51d887d73a70a44bcd5beac01074918348f24052a7d757c7d4c61", "ja": "とりあえず、ミーティングに入ろうか。\nみんなにいい知らせがあるんだ！", "zh": "总之，我们先开始会议吧。\n我有件好消息要告诉各位！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "f2606edd405cc6210cf9ca30300069752e5e14a5227c095e8037a01ec9eb6f56", "ja": "ふふっ、無事にオーディションに受かって良かったわ。\nとっても面白そうなドラマだもの♪", "zh": "呵呵，可以顺利通过试镜真是太好了。\n那出电视剧感觉非常有趣呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1007_052kao", "source_sha256": "10055fbcafdde010aac1540816eefdcc1c0e3bfe9c30f8e73f5933a150b3c15c", "ja": "えっと……主人公の4人は、ルームシェアをして\n一緒に住んでいる、ごくごく普通の女性たち。", "zh": "我记得设定是……四名主角共同居住在一起，\n她们都是非常平凡的女性。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1008_052kao", "source_sha256": "ac0c548fe67e4497969d495cb8b89e040dcb1fd947d60e4f279eb0bfa8815f15", "ja": "それがある日、ひょんなことからセレブパーティー\nへの招待状を手に入れて……。", "zh": "但有一天，\n她们意外获得名流派对的邀请函……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1009_052kao", "source_sha256": "c9d89f1ae2492aea5ad74e70d2498f961b128e7d532dd810e00e0d877f79a031", "ja": "パーティーにふさわしい、セクシーな自分になるために\n頑張るお話、でしたよね。", "zh": "于是她们努力让自己成为与派对相称的性感女性。\n印象中剧情是这样对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1d43f473e9042aeba75828fbedaf3c098a6e965ed41ba7ac7df4953d7ef954a6", "ja": "はい。あと莉緒にも、同僚役として\n出演してもらう予定です。", "zh": "对。另外莉绪预计也会参加演出，\n饰演主角的同事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "94179ea53bb5e2c152d75a1b9757328fc97ade1f791abccb062e6acef4371a09", "ja": "私が演じる好美はバリバリのキャリアウーマン！\n元会社員として、演じがいのありそうな役ね。", "zh": "我饰演的好美是精明干练的职场女性！\n身为前上班族，这个角色似乎值得我挑战呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1012_052kao", "source_sha256": "1d4014e1c80338d27d7b0f2c7882d15fab3685125b39e72937f75b28708a9691", "ja": "私は、好美と同期の佳織を演じるんですよね。\n流されやすいところとか、少し似ているかも……。", "zh": "我演的是与好美同期进公司的佳织。\n容易随波逐流的个性，可能跟我有点像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "771455ccc40b4127e72244730f7b91f269bc84577daaa12927213fa20001d62d", "ja": "今回のドラマで一番気にいっているのは、\n「セクシー＆アダルティ」がテーマってところ！", "zh": "说到这次电视剧我最喜欢的地方，\n就在于主题是「性感＆成熟」！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "87112c91d1e412df69152292f7973ea72ed1e0132f9ccb38b5f33d2d1e54d5a3", "ja": "まさに、私のためのドラマよね！\nいつも以上にセクシーを磨かなくちゃ！", "zh": "简直就是为我打造的电视剧！\n我得展现出超越以往的性感魅力才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "45e5e57106874c778b04c47071dce431289a64d5d4f94a5dfc9126dd02aef2fd", "ja": "セクシー……。ちょっと恥ずかしいですけど、\nためらっていてはダメですよね。アイドルですもの！", "zh": "性感……虽然有点难为情，但我不该这么放不开对吧。\n毕竟我是偶像嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "68233bc0d2d65436d859411971cce3f48b30644fa7c70409eeddb91a325088d2", "ja": "そ、そうですね。時には必要です！", "zh": "是、是呀，有时候这是必要的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1017_052kao", "source_sha256": "3b95cad5a17175156ec6f85c8eddfe9368f230c44138d51de0312fbbb96b5c2d", "ja": "あとで莉緒ちゃんに教わらなくっちゃ……。\nこのみさんも、相談にのってもらえますか？", "zh": "我之后得向莉绪请教才行……\n还有木实，要是有问题能找你商量吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1018_039kon", "source_sha256": "f65083797620657653d2f333f4c640f31bd3241ada05cee573070082f963923a", "ja": "ウフフ、もちろん！\n一緒にコスメでも買いに行きましょうか♪", "zh": "呵呵，当然可以！\n我们一起去买些化妆品还是什么吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "3423eed598f802352b38f14453563cf18e1244e4c03a367b50aade33f6b3e3bf", "ja": "私は看護師の楓果って役なんですよね！　\n元看護師の経験を活かせるといいなって思います♪", "zh": "我演的角色是护理师枫果呢！\n希望我能活用过去当护理师的经验♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1020_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6b4ec2dc5f9782f8ce1481617ab922e72d25cb0c3255c2c5a912b907474a16fb", "ja": "でも、セクシーな自分を目指すドラマかぁ。\nあの、やっぱり衣装も……セクシーなんですか？", "zh": "不过，目标是让自己变得更性感的电视剧啊。\n请问一下，服装想必……也很性感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c5a915593bef9e954859e297b491bc8b95e32865ec05dfa35cfed20f2d604e60", "ja": "ど、どうかな。基本は「ごく普通の女性」だから、\nだいたい大丈夫じゃないか？", "zh": "不、不清楚呢。主角基本上是「非常平凡的女性」，\n所以应该没什么问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "be2f6c7e9387890d7de18e7d1e518886a0e79c626b65eb241b853a6ec8702f9b", "ja": "あっ、そうですよね！　よかった、楽しみにしてます！\n普通の、清純な衣装……♪", "zh": "啊，这么说也是！太好了，我会期待的！\n平凡的清纯服装……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1023_p", "source_sha256": "92740e20921826159ced44b93b8f0f0423005b41a9b1fab6b5ee7c6193954aa1", "ja": "（ドラマの見どころ、セレブパーティーのシーンでは、\nみんなにセクシーなドレスを着てもらう予定だが……）", "zh": "（剧中最有看头的名流派对那一幕，\n预计请所有人穿上性感礼服……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "e74f16afcf65d136e42977d4cab3c1b7652fe2f83b279b06024d8a9655988bce", "ja": "（風花のモチベ維持のためにも、\n今はあえて、言わないことにしよう！）", "zh": "（为了维持风花的干劲，现在就先别提吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "ff7fc4bd07cc66ae9ec599002c86ec49890b4bdc04c62996c2299de602463089", "ja": "私は大学生の玲香を演じるんですね。とっても\n普通そうな女の子で、撮影、楽しみになっちゃいます♪", "zh": "我是饰演大学生玲香。\n她是非常平凡的女孩子，让我好期待拍摄♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1026_039kon", "source_sha256": "6d9a1da2e8bfd71794d9d4cb72dccf0cd0f9f7bdcebcada476bdd6727a404e59", "ja": "そういえば、麗花ちゃんって大学生なのよね。\nちょっと意外な気がするわ。", "zh": "这么说起来，丽花是大学生对吧。\n感觉有点意外。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "4ee0c003717d7cefb3ead86a53620f150d61635f6a42dd9ea161e771b5666f35", "ja": "お仕事のない日は、元気に大学通ってますよ。昨日は\n授業の後、お友達とカフェでテスト勉強をしました。", "zh": "没有工作的日子，我就会带着饱满的精神上学去喔。\n昨天下课后，我还跟朋友在咖啡厅做考前复习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "13c3f9c09326060f97ca4f33bf4bd874a4ca40ce6178edb4171b768b67d20da6", "ja": "まぁ、みんな同じなのね。私も学生時代は、\nよく友達とカフェに集まって勉強していたの。", "zh": "哎呀，看来大家都一样呢。\n我在学生时期，也经常跟朋友聚在咖啡厅里念书。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1029_052kao", "source_sha256": "b7fe8a53d23de2ca41f773143d802462c7709894914b719eeee7aa5841e5f098", "ja": "でもいつの間にか、お喋りに夢中になったりして。\nふふっ♪", "zh": "但是不知不觉就聊得太投入，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1030_041fuk", "source_sha256": "160f114dd1746e6a89cf55555e53ce6cc7f370687d6a67aa746944ed77282486", "ja": "キャンパスライフって感じでいいですね！\n看護学校も楽しかったけど、実習は大変だったなぁ。", "zh": "这种大学生活的感觉真不错！\n我读护理学校虽然也很开心，但实习非常累人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1031_039kon", "source_sha256": "ee7f7acdcacc416ce932457a3cb23a4e6de62ebfa6a03e41b93ab0f38e85d813", "ja": "看護学校かぁ。未知の世界だけど、そうよね。\n風花ちゃんは看護師さんだったわけだし。", "zh": "护理学校啊，那对我来说是未知的世界。\n不过也对呢，风花之前是护理师嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "4ac750bd7b695193207b96013f74b0e7f6786c0b69049d9c7fce67a3e8686638", "ja": "考えてみれば私達って、\n意外とまだ、お互いのこと知らないのかも。", "zh": "仔细想想，\n我们说不定都还不是很了解彼此呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1033_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9d3af385d492b2db425077b9aac54e96777c5dab199758bafc1b6af74d39ec50", "ja": "そうですね。でも、これからは一緒にドラマを撮るん\nですから、たくさんお話できるかなって……。", "zh": "就是说啊。不过，我们接下来会一起拍摄电视剧，\n应该会有机会多聊聊吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "01ba5b4c546f6a8c9a70c1ec6f97249e75cce61b8ceff8f31c4722945eb4ed5d", "ja": "それなら私、すっごくいいことを\n思いついちゃいました♪", "zh": "既然这样，\n我想到一个非常棒的好主意♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "663cbd975d9812c1583045722612018918c4adf6331fda9e0a4be03423a22d8d", "ja": "いいこと？", "zh": "好主意？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1036_048rei", "source_sha256": "193769f750418b697dc966c008c1612cfb40b2fb5ac2412fc58d95fb43b67dde", "ja": "はいっ♪　ドラマでは、\n4人でルームシェアしてるんですよね。", "zh": "是的♪\n电视剧里，四名主角共同居住在一起对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "31e7304417815d6ff44f91bce4b68b6095bf0daa001d0a7475df61ab825bbf87", "ja": "じゃあじゃあ、私達も、\n私の家でルームシェアしちゃいませんか？", "zh": "那么那么，\n我们要不要也一起在我家共居呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e0e37fb355ae8c6fdeb69db8a431af255722e064d793ee154c6ee8e702d1ee46", "ja": "ルームシェアって……え、4人で麗花ちゃんの部屋に？\nそんなに押しかけていいのかな……？", "zh": "共居……咦？要我们四个一起住在丽花的房间里？\n我们这么多人去打扰没关系吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1039_p", "source_sha256": "e9f2d770702fcd7e2e898e9209f16c0f8b654600686c8e7a15b264e81dcbf415", "ja": "麗花本人は、むしろ全力で来てほしそうだから……。\nみんながいいなら、それもいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "丽花本人倒是极力希望你们去的样子……\n如果你们方便，去住住也不错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1040_p", "source_sha256": "28467822474a5387110ecf6ca3569c927bd1209895f0272eb82f3775472ebf22", "ja": "いろいろと発見もありそうだし、\n確かに役作りには繋がると思う。", "zh": "感觉会有许多新发现，\n而且确实有助于揣摩角色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "1b7d09f16ae29ec50e08f7f21311ac2b7a5f5f5c018c764b361d6f5f089cd51c", "ja": "そうですよね♪　それじゃあ、\n10年位、みんなで一緒に暮らしましょう！", "zh": "就是说呀♪\n那我们一起当个十年室友吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1042_p", "source_sha256": "0f215994ac33bb875fcbcb262d69ca133d84170a19729af60a84b714a6e47e9d", "ja": "10年は長いな……。ルームシェアするなら、\nクランクインまでぐらいがちょうどいいと思うぞ。", "zh": "十年太长了吧……\n要共居的话，我认为持续到开镜前刚刚好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1043_039kon", "source_sha256": "4a413f331e5d3524385bca0c88fcaa426ff06aecd53b0015e5f98577c4b680d2", "ja": "それがいいわね。じゃあ、麗花ちゃん、みんな！\nクランクインまでの短い間だけどよろしくね♪", "zh": "我也赞成。那么丽花，还有大家！\n开镜前的短暂期间请多指教啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0032_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0032_story_01_1044_048rei", "source_sha256": "d71ac305c4e9487027314263374bf5f4dc549f9ad0c2fe230e10af592cc72e4c", "ja": "はーい♪", "zh": "好的──♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
